{"speciesId":56,"names":{"fr":"Férosinge","es":"Mankey","en":"Mankey","ja":"マンキー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment then thrashing away the next instant."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"An agile POKéMON that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It's unsafe to ap­ proach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can't distinguish friends from foes."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils vivent en colonies sylvestres. Quand un Férosinge s’énerve, toute la colonie suit son exemple."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ils vivent en colonies sylvestres. Quand un Férosinge s’énerve, toute la colonie suit son exemple."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il ne peut dissocier ses amis de ses ennemis et a tendance à enrager lorsqu’on l’approche."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es peligroso acercarse si se enfada sin razón aparente, ya que no distingue entre amigos y enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"意味もなく 怒って 暴れ出すと 仲間の 区別も つかなくなるので 近寄るのは 非常に 危険だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ils vivent en colonies sylvestres. Quand un Férosinge s’énerve, toute la colonie suit son exemple."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en colonias en los árboles. Si uno se enfada, el resto de la manada ataca sin motivo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"木の上で 生活している。 群れの １匹が 怒り出すと 全員が 意味もなく 暴れ出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque Férosinge commence à trembler et que sa respiration devient haletante, cela signifie qu’il est en colère. En outre, la moutarde lui monte au nez tellement vite qu’il est presque impossible d’échapper à sa colère."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体が 震え 鼻息が 荒くなれば 怒りだす 前触れ なのだが あっという間に 激しく 怒るので 逃げ出す 暇は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Férosinge commence à trembler et que sa respiration devient haletante, cela signifie qu’il est en colère. En outre, la moutarde lui monte au nez tellement vite qu’il est presque impossible d’échapper à sa colère."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体が 震え 鼻息が 荒くなれば 怒りだす 前触れ なのだが あっという間に 激しく 怒るので 逃げ出す 暇は ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Quand il pique soudain une terrible colère, tout le monde autour de lui s’enfuit. Mais il supporte mal la solitude, et ça l’énerve encore davantage."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se enfada sin razón aparente. Cuando todos lo dejan solo para no tener que lidiar con su ira, Mankey se enoja más aún."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages, and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"前触れもなく 突然 怒る。 暴れまくって 誰も いなくなると 孤独に 耐えられなくて また怒る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Fatigué de sa colère permanente, il lui arrive de dormir, mais il rêve de ses frustrations, se réveille, et se met en colère d’avoir été réveillé."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Tras desatar su ira, le entra sueño y se duerme. Sin embargo, sus pesadillas lo atormentan aún más, por lo que se despierta de muy mal humor."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its raging tires it out and causes it to fall asleep, but the anger resonating in its dreams causes it to wake up—which infuriates it all over again."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"怒り散らして 疲れて 眠るが 夢の 中で 腹を立て 怒りで 目覚め 目覚めたことに また怒る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La moindre contrariété le rend furieux. Comme rien ne l’atteint durablement, il n’accumule pas de stress et peut vivre très vieux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se encoleriza enseguida por cualquier minucia. Por otro lado, al no acumular estrés, suele gozar de una vida longeva."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The smallest of things could cause it to lose its temper. Because it doesn’t hold in its stress, this Pokémon can live a long time."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ちょっとしたことで すぐ 怒る。 ストレスを ため込まないので かなり 長生きする ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il suffit qu’un Férosinge s’énerve pour que ses congénères en fassent de même, aussi leurs groupes ne connaissent-ils jamais la paix."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cuando un ejemplar se enfada, contagia su ira al resto, por lo que los grupos de Mankey desconocen el concepto de vida reposada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"１匹が 怒りだすと まわりも 怒りだすので マンキーの 群れに 静寂が 訪れることは ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Agile et rapide, ce Pokémon vit dans les arbres. Il s’énerve facilement et s’attaque à tout ce qui bouge quand il est en colère."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"身軽で 木の上で 生活する。 ふとしたことで 機嫌が 悪くなり まわりに いるものに 飛びかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Agile et rapide, ce Pokémon vit dans les arbres. Il s’énerve facilement et s’attaque à tout ce qui bouge quand il est en colère."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"An agile Po